      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Invullen na importeren\n1. **Run due searches** → URL: vervang `https://JOUW-APP-URL` door je `APP_URL` (bv. `https://jobhunter.vercel.app`)\n2. **Run due searches** → Header Auth *n8n → JobHunter* (`Authorization` = `Bearer <N8N_SECRET>`)\n3. Workflow publiceren (**Publish**; in n8n-versies vóór 2.0 heet dit **Active**).\n4. Interval staat op 30 min: n8n Cloud Starter heeft 2.500 executions per maand (15 min ≈ 2.900). Eigen server of hoger plan? 15 min mag.",
